# Maze Solver Using Recursive Backtracking

## Description
This project solves a maze using the Recursive Backtracking algorithm in C++.

## Technologies
- C++
- Recursion
- Backtracking
- 2D Arrays

## Files
- main.cpp
- maze.h
- maze.cpp

## How to Run
1. Open the project in VS Code.
2. Open the terminal.
3. Compile:

   g++ main.cpp maze.cpp -o MazeSolver

4. Execute:

   .\MazeSolver.exe

